Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.31,0:00:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(鲨鱼)谢了 游马 星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.92,0:00:09.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我此生挚友。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.99,0:00:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能和你们最后……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.95,0:00:16.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打出最棒的决斗真是太好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.12,0:00:20.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)鲨鱼!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.45,0:00:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再见了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.43,0:00:34.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(特隆)地上世界渐渐远去。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.24,0:00:37.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(一马)嗯世界的危机被拯救了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.52,0:00:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但这样一来游马就……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.53,0:00:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管怎么说 你愿意出手相助 我得道声谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.97,0:00:48.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 那时候欠的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.14,0:00:51.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}人情 算是稍微还上一点了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.19,0:00:52.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特隆……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.17,0:00:54.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永别了 一马。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.83,0:00:59.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢你 特隆。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.15,0:01:09.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《星光体：游马……》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.02,0:01:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德之助)呜…… 呜哇…… 这里是？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.68,0:01:20.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)德之助君!?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.29,0:01:21.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.44,0:01:28.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)呃！我……游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.25,0:01:33.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(安娜)我们到底……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.29,0:01:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们因为打倒了鲨鱼{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.96,0:01:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安世界与地上世界的融合得以解除{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.36,0:01:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被夺走的众多灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.77,0:01:44.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}应该是回到了这个世界吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.06,0:01:49.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})这里是……这样啊，我……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.12,0:01:54.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅴ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})看来游马他们帮我们搞定了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.66,0:01:57.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})是的。但是游马一定……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.70,0:02:02.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.15,0:02:04.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.52,0:02:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全都是多亏了你啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:09.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家 大家都回来了对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.78,0:02:11.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}≪{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.08,0:02:14.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.91,0:02:15.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.86,0:02:17.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.54,0:02:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.16,0:02:20.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(罗宾/安娜)游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.44,0:02:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安娜！罗宾！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.63,0:02:27.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.53,0:04:01.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家 大家都平安无事啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.30,0:04:04.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就知道你一定能做到的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.84,0:04:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也一直相信着你！游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.29,0:04:09.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯 这也是多亏了你们。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.17,0:04:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(春人)游马我们赢了对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.38,0:04:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}春人…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.44,0:04:17.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.12,0:04:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.33,0:04:21.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对不起 春人。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.00,0:04:24.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 快斗也好 鲨鱼也好 璃绪也好{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.47,0:04:27.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这场战斗中 谁都没能…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.27,0:04:29.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁都没能拯救。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.72,0:04:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对我来说，决斗这回事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.37,0:04:36.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗到底是什么究竟算什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.76,0:04:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.36,0:05:07.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.95,0:05:10.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}100张 No.卡全部集齐{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.89,0:05:13.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如今 出现在了我们面前。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.26,0:05:19.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是铭刻着全宇宙未来与过去的卡片。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.95,0:05:21.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.代码！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.60,0:05:25.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来完成最后使命的时刻似乎到来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.71,0:05:30.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}改写这 No.代码就是我的使命。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.07,0:05:32.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将所有的过去与未来都改写。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.84,0:05:35.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.37,0:05:38.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶界依然存在着。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.53,0:05:40.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说 你！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.69,0:05:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要让异晶界消灭。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.52,0:05:49.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会… 你是认真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.02,0:05:52.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安世界是混沌的根源。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.08,0:05:55.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不能将它留着。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.45,0:05:59.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔世界不是已经改变了吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.09,0:06:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在牺牲什么的基础上，根本不会有未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.16,0:06:05.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不是应该明白了吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.29,0:06:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要继续战斗总有一天能开辟未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.74,0:06:11.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要把那份可能性给抛弃掉吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.42,0:06:14.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那到底是为了什么，你和我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.28,0:06:15.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才一直战斗到现在啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.75,0:06:18.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场战斗到底算什么啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.99,0:06:22.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的答案不会改变。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.40,0:06:27.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消灭巴利安世界。这是我的使命。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.27,0:06:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种事……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.11,0:06:31.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种事我绝对不会让你得逞！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.46,0:06:32.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，你打算怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.89,0:06:35.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就 那就 决斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.94,0:06:38.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你和我的…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.96,0:06:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将命运代码所昭示的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.96,0:06:43.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你打算把那个未来 赌在这场决斗上吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.06,0:06:44.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.38,0:06:44.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我这边{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.08,0:06:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有的 No.卡都已集齐。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.77,0:06:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个世界的任何人都赢不了我。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.83,0:06:54.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}即便如此你也要战斗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.90,0:06:56.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我赢了的话 你就服从我！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.29,0:06:59.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好吧。 那么我赢的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.19,0:07:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让巴利安世界消灭{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.75,0:07:07.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 关于我的你的记忆也 全部消除。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.05,0:07:10.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.08,0:07:12.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.73,0:07:17.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 傍晚 地点在站前广场。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.95,0:07:20.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.73,0:07:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(咔嚓)星光体呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.91,0:07:23.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发生了什么，乌拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.77,0:07:26.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马？》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.44,0:07:32.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《Astral
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.68,0:07:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了赢那家伙的卡组》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.72,0:07:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这明明是我和那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.41,0:07:42.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最初也是最后的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.80,0:07:46.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我对那家伙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.24,0:07:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙对我居然完全都不了解》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.39,0:07:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(一马)Astral。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.42,0:07:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我把你送到了游马身边。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.45,0:08:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而你们漂亮地完成了使命。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.33,0:08:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，还没有。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.67,0:08:09.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我还有使用 No.代码的职责
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.46,0:08:10.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}尚未完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.79,0:08:13.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论你做出怎样的决断
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.06,0:08:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那都是你们的未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.39,0:08:19.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一切，不都在你的计算之中吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.64,0:08:22.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，会怎样呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.16,0:08:24.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你已经察觉到了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.46,0:08:26.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马他……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.91,0:08:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要战斗吗，和那家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.70,0:08:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是的，全力以赴。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.93,0:08:36.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}振作点，我！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.94,0:08:39.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和Astral的决斗，那家伙的卡组里{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.04,0:08:42.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有的 No.和希望都齐了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.27,0:08:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果是那家伙的话，一定……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.55,0:08:56.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉抱歉刹车失灵了嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.17,0:08:59.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安娜，为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.62,0:09:00.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)总而言之！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.11,0:09:02.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要和Astral决斗对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.28,0:09:04.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(罗宾)大显身手呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.74,0:09:05.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}羡慕羡慕！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.32,0:09:07.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}担心得不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.53,0:09:08.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来看你啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.32,0:09:11.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦，你们这帮家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.93,0:09:15.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(明里)真是的闹得可真够欢的啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.72,0:09:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(春)这下决斗饭得加量啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.50,0:09:20.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(奶奶)笨蛋 别吵 别吵。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.23,0:09:25.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过游马什么时候有了那么多朋友啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.39,0:09:29.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的 多亏了决斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.63,0:09:31.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 对了明里。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.31,0:09:36.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也用决斗试着找个女婿呗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.45,0:09:37.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奶奶！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.01,0:09:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.39,0:09:41.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 决斗啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.40,0:09:44.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛 倒也不坏吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.35,0:09:47.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛啊 你们几个一起。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.56,0:09:49.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我正忙着做卡组呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.37,0:09:51.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正因为这样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.20,0:09:52.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才来给你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.96,0:09:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大把大把地送卡啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.05,0:09:55.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.26,0:09:58.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底 星光体的卡组……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.16,0:10:00.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有的 No.卡都齐了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.13,0:10:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要对抗那个的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.26,0:10:05.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}需要强力的卡组吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.40,0:10:07.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不介意的话，用我们的卡吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.06,0:10:10.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家都想一起和星光体战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.60,0:10:11.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.70,0:10:14.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毕竟受了星光体不少照顾嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.89,0:10:18.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了游马，用吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.34,0:10:18.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.21,0:10:19.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.29,0:10:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.37,0:10:23.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.92,0:10:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是这次的决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.21,0:10:28.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想靠我一个人的力量来战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.00,0:10:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对，唯独这场决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.03,0:10:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不靠我自己的力量去战斗就没有意义。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.34,0:10:35.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马……》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.62,0:10:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说得也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.84,0:10:39.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对你来说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.67,0:10:42.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是与星光体最初也是最后的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.89,0:10:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道了。 你就按自己的方式拼尽全力去撞撞看吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.55,0:10:49.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.60,0:10:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要和大家的心意一起战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.34,0:10:56.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我燃起来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.90,0:11:00.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总觉得好不可思议。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.59,0:11:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明以前像这样走着的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.02,0:11:05.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体一直陪在身边呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.73,0:11:08.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.92,0:11:09.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.04,0:11:13.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你一直都在看着我们的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.05,0:11:17.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我只想跟你说清楚。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.00,0:11:18.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.17,0:11:31.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡组准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.89,0:11:35.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 完美。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.24,0:11:38.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(抽卡)终于 那两个人要战斗了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.94,0:11:41.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马现在是什么心情呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.71,0:11:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.19,0:11:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只会全力冲上去罢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.72,0:11:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加油啊 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.15,0:11:48.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}祝愿两人奋战到底！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.86,0:11:49.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}羡慕羡慕！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.93,0:11:51.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体也加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.19,0:11:53.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《大家都不知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.32,0:11:55.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗真正的意义》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.70,0:11:59.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的假的 那个。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.40,0:12:03.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这座城市的上空产生了异常的重力场。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.94,0:12:07.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来是 No.卡出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.23,0:12:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这应该不会有错。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.32,0:12:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 难道说 这场决斗是……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.75,0:12:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此 就是为了那个的决斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.85,0:12:16.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.37,0:12:20.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}改写过去与未来的究极之卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.87,0:12:25.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《但愿 那份力量仍未归来的灵魂……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.86,0:12:26.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海马
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.81,0:12:30.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马他们打算使用 No.卡吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.40,0:12:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不清楚。不过 这场决斗中
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.97,0:12:35.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}似乎就有那个答案。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.43,0:12:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马这一刻 终于到来了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.89,0:12:42.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从与你相遇之时起{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.85,0:12:44.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总有一天 这一天会到来我……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.37,0:12:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是与你最初也是最后的决斗》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.04,0:12:53.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体 从那时起{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.46,0:12:56.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总有一天离别会到来我明白的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.07,0:13:00.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没想到 竟会以这种形式啊》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.00,0:13:03.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要开始了 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.54,0:13:05.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.40,0:13:07.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}热血沸腾啊 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.76,0:13:12.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.36,0:13:21.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.36,0:13:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗目标 锁定！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.75,0:13:30.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[扬声器]AR影像 链接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.09,0:13:36.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(两人)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.72,0:13:43.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻我拿下了我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.67,0:13:49.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这就是 与那家伙的最初也是最后的决斗》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.64,0:13:54.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《上吧 星光体》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.82,0:14:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 隆隆隆石人以攻击表示召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.86,0:14:03.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再盖上3张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.37,0:14:08.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.75,0:14:12.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然特意将隆隆隆石人以攻击表示召唤》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.48,0:14:17.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了 我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.74,0:14:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 永续魔法 平行单位！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.17,0:14:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.93,0:14:27.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以选择对方场上的1只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.88,0:14:31.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以当作相同等级的怪兽卡来使用。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.15,0:14:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且，我还要发动永续魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.30,0:14:36.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}固体超量射线！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.21,0:14:40.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以作为阶级4的超量召唤的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.06,0:14:41.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}素材来使用。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.51,0:14:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这么快就来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.54,0:14:46.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级4的并行单元和
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.33,0:14:49.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}固体超量射线进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.59,0:14:51.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.08,0:14:56.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.39。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.98,0:15:01.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的战斗，从此开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.71,0:15:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将希望托付于白色之翼。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.82,0:15:08.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光之使者，希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.19,0:15:12.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体从一开始就全力以赴。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.25,0:15:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.39,0:15:17.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.91,0:15:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我竟然要和霍普战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.94,0:15:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我还要从手牌发动
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.56,0:15:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶魔法 霍普之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.18,0:15:28.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡持有2个超量单元
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.66,0:15:30.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以希望皇霍普为对象发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.34,0:15:33.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从霍普身上取1个或2个{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.59,0:15:36.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将阶级更高的2只怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.25,0:15:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.08,0:15:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将霍普的超量单元分配给它。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.69,0:15:44.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双重阶级提升 超量变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.75,0:15:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.39。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.33,0:15:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普雷·胜利！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.76,0:16:02.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.39 希望皇彼岸·霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.29,0:16:09.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普一下子变成3只！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.46,0:16:11.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.18,0:16:14.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动彼岸·霍普的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.96,0:16:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己回合的战斗期间{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.00,0:16:19.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方怪兽的攻击力变成零。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.66,0:16:22.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下不妙啊。哇啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.31,0:16:25.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普3只的攻击要来了喵。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.78,0:16:28.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想得美！ 发动陷阱卡 守卫者！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.15,0:16:32.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己场上的怪兽变为守备表示。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.21,0:16:36.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我再抽1张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.40,0:16:38.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此，用陷阱卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.80,0:16:40.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把隆隆隆石人变成守备表示。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.83,0:16:42.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后再抽1张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.75,0:16:45.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，游马就能扛过两次战斗了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.59,0:16:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，星光体恐怕……。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.63,0:16:51.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，我就用希望皇·胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.24,0:16:53.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击隆隆隆石人。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.01,0:16:56.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个瞬间希望皇·胜利的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.10,0:16:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗时
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.94,0:17:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.31,0:17:02.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效对方怪兽的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.21,0:17:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，直到胜利的战斗结束为止{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.38,0:17:09.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不能发动魔法、陷阱卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.76,0:17:12.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，希望皇·胜利。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.61,0:17:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望剑双重胜利斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.27,0:17:25.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动陷阱防护罩！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.88,0:17:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上的 嘎嘎嘎 咯咯咯 嘟嘟嘟
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.44,0:17:30.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}之名的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.38,0:17:31.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在被破坏的回合可以发动{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.20,0:17:35.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那些怪兽从墓地 复活。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.27,0:17:39.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧 咯咯咯魔像！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.18,0:17:43.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再从手牌将 嘎嘎嘎 咯咯咯 嘟嘟嘟
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.09,0:17:44.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}之名的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.56,0:17:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最多２只 以守备表示特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.64,0:17:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 嘟嘟嘟战士！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.13,0:17:52.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 嘎嘎嘎魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.88,0:17:59.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真有你的 居然是两段式防守。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.73,0:18:02.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彼岸·希望 攻击嘎嘎嘎魔术师。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.72,0:18:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着 用希望皇霍普
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.84,0:18:11.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击嘟嘟嘟战士。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.25,0:18:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 总算是勉强防住了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.52,0:18:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可不好说？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.28,0:18:20.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动速攻魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.62,0:18:24.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶魔法 暗黑之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.59,0:18:27.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？第二张升阶魔法？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.99,0:18:30.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果是，自己的超量怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.74,0:18:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗中破坏对方怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.21,0:18:36.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那只超量怪兽送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.57,0:18:39.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从比那个阶级高1阶和高2阶的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.85,0:18:41.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量怪兽中选2只{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.51,0:18:45.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将效果无效化并超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.76,0:18:48.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将希望皇霍普送去墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.15,0:18:54.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，阶级5，CNo.39
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.56,0:18:56.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普雷V！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.04,0:19:00.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.49,0:19:04.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阶级6，No.25 重装光学摄影机焦点之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.54,0:19:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连霍普雷V都加上焦点之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.27,0:19:12.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完。发动速攻魔法，异热同心！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.92,0:19:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果是，超量怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.09,0:19:16.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被送去墓地时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.12,0:19:19.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将相同阶级的混沌超量怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.93,0:19:22.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将效果无效并特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.82,0:19:28.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.39 希望皇霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.72,0:19:36.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}furthermore 我发动彼岸·霍普的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.72,0:19:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个超量单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.95,0:19:41.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己场上的怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.11,0:19:41.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}除外一只{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.51,0:19:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这只怪兽从墓地特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.61,0:19:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.39 希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.77,0:19:54.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我将希望皇霍普的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.17,0:19:55.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力的一半{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.56,0:19:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恢复生命值。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.40,0:20:10.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}五只霍普齐聚一堂。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.68,0:20:12.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是场惊人的决斗啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.62,0:20:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 星光他到底……。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.49,0:20:17.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马虽然在拼命坚持……。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.61,0:20:19.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样根本算不上胜负啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.89,0:20:21.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是星光的真正实力。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.80,0:20:23.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(安娜)是不是做得太过火了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.53,0:20:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么感觉好可怕。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.12,0:20:27.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)跟平时的Astral好像不太一样啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.51,0:20:28.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((那
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.98,0:20:31.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果这场决斗Astral赢了的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.62,0:20:33.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯  Astral
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.01,0:20:35.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会怎么使用 No.代码{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.76,0:20:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就看这个了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.11,0:20:37.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.22,0:20:38.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是小鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.81,0:20:40.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望大家不要把这件事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.49,0:20:41.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说出去。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.79,0:20:42.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.31,0:20:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙无论输赢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.46,0:20:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗都会是最后一场。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.60,0:20:49.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在大家心里 想让那家伙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.71,0:20:51.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到最后都保持好人的形象
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.66,0:20:53.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是这么想的))
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.66,0:20:58.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普 攻击五哥五哥魔像！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.67,0:21:01.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 守备表示的五哥五哥魔像
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.38,0:21:02.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.50,0:21:04.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击不会被破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.42,0:21:08.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.91,0:21:12.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我的怪兽的攻击还有剩余。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.84,0:21:17.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 希望皇！ 希望剑·混沌斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.08,0:21:22.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}继续下去。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.29,0:21:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇V！ 对游马直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.39,0:21:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望剑 V字斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.04,0:21:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体真的……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.80,0:21:49.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊。是真心想击溃游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.35,0:21:51.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是不是做得太过分了？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.08,0:21:53.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超级糟……。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.57,0:21:55.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.01,0:23:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.03,0:23:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
